<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  1.91 %		     C/S =  8.26 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  1.27 %		     O/N = 10.17 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  3.82 %		     T/N =  2.54 %</p>
<p>		   March  3, 1997			Feb 28, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.77 %     1 month forward =  6.44 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.28 %     2 month forward =  7.46 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  6.34 %     3 month forward =  7.23 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  6.45 %     4 month forward =  7.12 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  6.59 %     5 month forward =  7.46 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  6.59 %     6 month forward =  7.19 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
